Hadamard -- a package to study Hadamard products of varieties.
**************************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides a class for representing points in projective space and
methods for computing Hadamard products of varieties.

Author
======

  * Iman Bahmani Jafarloo (see http://calvino.polito.it/~imanbj )
    <ibahmani89@gmail.com>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.1 of Hadamard, released November 2020.

