|     Point{1, 4, 8}, Point{1, 0, 16}, Point{1, 0, 1}, Point{1, 1, -},        |
|                                                                  8          |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                 1                                                           |
|     Point{1, 0, -}, Point{1, 0, 2}}                                         |
