hadamardProduct(List) -- Hadamard product of a list of homogeneous ideals, or points
************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note hadamardProduct: hadamardProduct,
  * Usage: 
        hadamardProduct(L)
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of *note (homogeneous) ideals:
        (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal, or *note (projective) points: Point,
  * Outputs:
      * an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, 
      * an instance of the type *note Point: Point,, 

Description
===========

The Hadamard product of a list of ideals or points constructed by using
iteratively the binary function *note hadamardProduct(Ideal,Ideal):
hadamardProduct_lpIdeal_cmIdeal_rp,, or  *note Point * Point: Point _st Point,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[x,y,z,t];                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(random(1,S),random(1,S));                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of S                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : J = ideal(random(1,S),random(1,S));                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of S                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : L = {I,J};                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : hadamardProduct(L)                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|                         2                                2                  |
|o5 = ideal(1640666412000x  - 127984188150x*y - 4545263450y  + 386029884240x*z|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                   2                                         |
|     + 10982114325y*z - 1366052688z  + 6948299255625x*t - 676631565675y*t +  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                    2                                        |
|     67421131245z*t + 1514925696375t )                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Ideal of S                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : P = point\{{1,2,3},{-1,1,1},{1,1/2,-1/3}}                               |
|                                                                             |
|                                                1    1                       |
|o6 = {Point{1, 2, 3}, Point{-1, 1, 1}, Point{1, -, - -}}                     |
|                                                2    3                       |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : hadamardProduct(P)                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = Point{-1, 1, -1}                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : Point                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

